  "effect_entries": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "からだを　こうそくに　かいてん　させて\nたいあたりする。あいてより　すばやさが\nひくいほど　つよい。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "몸을 고속으로 회전시켜\n몸통박치기한다. 상대보다 스피드가\n낮을수록 위력은 올라간다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "高速旋轉身體，撞擊對手。\n速度比對手越慢，威力越大。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Le lanceur effectue une rotation et frappe l’ennemi.\nPlus la Vitesse du lanceur est basse, plus il inflige\nde dégâts.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Angriff mit hoher Geschwindigkeit. Je niedriger die\nInitiative des Anwenders im Vergleich zum Ziel ist,\ndesto höher der Schaden.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Embiste al objetivo con un potente ataque giratorio.\nCuanto más lento es el usuario, más daño causa.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Chi la usa si scaglia sul bersaglio facendo ruotare\nvorticosamente il proprio corpo. Più lento è chi la usa,\nmaggiore è il danno.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The user tackles the target with a high-speed spin.\nThe slower the user compared to the target, the\ngreater the move’s power.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "体を　高速に　回転させて\n体当たりする。相手より　素早さが\n低いほど　強い。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "让身体高速旋转并撞击对手。\n速度比对手越慢，威力越大。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Embiste al objetivo con un potente ataque giratorio.\nCuanto más lento es el usuario, más daño causa.",
      "version_group": {
